flowchart TB
    Authors["Person 4 with another reviewer<br/>Prepare and review questions"]
    Types["Three types<br/>Multiple choice / output / code gaps"]
    Validate["Check wording, accepted answers,<br/>sizes, gap names, and explanations"]
    Bank["Draft becomes active after review<br/>Store through shared database access"]
    Authors --> Types --> Validate --> Bank
    API["Protected question API<br/>List / read / create / update / archive"]
    API -->|"API key, limits, validation"| Validate
    Bank -->|"Safe public question only"| Page["Person 1 displays the question"]
    Bank -->|"Private frozen copy"| Game["Person 2 runs the match"]
    Game -->|"Submitted answer and private question"| Checker["Check prepared accepted answers<br/>No compiler or LLM"]
    Checker --> Decision{"Matches an accepted answer?"}
    Decision -->|"Yes"| Correct["Correct"]
    Decision -->|"No"| Wrong["Incorrect"]
    Correct -->|"Result only"| Game
    Wrong -->|"Result only"| Game
    Game --> Scoring["Person 2 applies score and winner rules"]
    Optional["We need to agree:<br/>how strictly do we compare answers?"]
    Optional -.-> Checker

